<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance S.A. has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.JUL.97		 PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	     STRIKE     ISSUE	PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL 23	  17500 YEN  $1.61	9.92 PCT   10 X</p>
<p> CALL 24	  18500 YEN  $1.13	9.36 PCT   14 X</p>
<p> CALL 25	  19500 YEN  $0.79	12 69 PCT  20 X</p>
<p> PUT  11	  16500 YEN  $0.84	14.32 PCT  19 X</p>
<p> PUT  12	  17500 YEN  $1.10	10.47 PCT  14 X</p>
<p> PUT  13	  18500 YEN  $1.49	7.46 PCT   10 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
